 ly\, and features for Shawn Gardini\, Dan Soder\, and tours with Nick Mulle
 n. Aidan has appeared on the Adam Friedland Show and Barstool's The Yak\, S
 on of a Boy Dad\, and ANUS. He was also a performer at Skankfest in Las Veg
 as 2024 and hosts his semi-regular podcast\, Goat Mentality.\n\nCouple's Pa
